OL,3,GNEWSAThese Storm Boelo images were not
OL,4,AAI - but some people thought they were
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe collapse of a stone wall in an
OL,7,Fhistorical churchyard may not be the
OL,8,Fmost likely reason to discuss
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI).
OL,11,FThe battle over the regulation of the
OL,12,Ftechnology, copyright law, use of data
OL,13,Fcentres and more are frequently in the
OL,14,Fspotlight just now.
OL,16,FBut the question of AI-generated images
OL,17,Fis one that refuses to go away - and
OL,18,Fduring Storm Boelo, that question
OL,19,Freared its head again.
